e - face unending waves of aliens and see how long you can last! <strong>Unlock it after completing the campaign.</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Development Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by third-year students at Breda University of Applied Sciences, Oh, Bugger! delivers intense action, strategic mech customization, and a uniquely stylized space environment for an unforgettable gaming experience.</p>","developers":["Hostile Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365900/0bc8844d31a9c64087c6d9658b7854897e88d1a3/header.jpg?t=1751321464","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3365900/276639067/458a494936f93d31b97daf0a7d66efa2a34a513a/1750326643/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750341419","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3365900/276639067/458a494936f93d31b97daf0a7d66efa2a34a513a/1750326643/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750341419","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3365900/276639067/458a494936f93d31b97daf0a7d66efa2a34a513a/1750326643/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1750341419","id":257158704,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158704/movie480.mp4?t=1750341419","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158704/movie_max.mp4?t=1750341419"},"name":"Official Full Release","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257158704/e5637b93f6c50765caf378b79c259c2e567b0fea/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750341419","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158704/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1750341419","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158704/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1750341419"}}],"name":"Oh, Bugger!","package_groups":[],"pc_require